@startuml arsitektur_unet
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #333333
skinparam arrowColor #333333

title Arsitektur U-Net (Ronneberger et al., 2015)

' === Left Column: Encoder ===
rectangle "**Input Image**\n(H × W × C)" as input #E8F5E9
rectangle "Conv 3×3 + ReLU\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\n(H × W × 64)" as enc1 #BBDEFB
rectangle "Max Pool 2×2\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\n(H/2 × W/2 × 128)" as enc2 #90CAF9
rectangle "Max Pool 2×2\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\n(H/4 × W/4 × 256)" as enc3 #64B5F6
rectangle "Max Pool 2×2\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\n(H/8 × W/8 × 512)" as enc4 #42A5F5

' === Center Bottom: Bottleneck ===
rectangle "Max Pool 2×2\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\n(H/16 × W/16 × 1024)" as bottleneck #FFA726

' === Right Column: Decoder ===
rectangle "Up-Conv 2×2 + Concat\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\n(H/8 × W/8 × 512)" as dec4 #EF5350
rectangle "Up-Conv 2×2 + Concat\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\n(H/4 × W/4 × 256)" as dec3 #EC407A
rectangle "Up-Conv 2×2 + Concat\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\n(H/2 × W/2 × 128)" as dec2 #AB47BC
rectangle "Up-Conv 2×2 + Concat\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\nConv 3×3 + ReLU\n(H × W × 64)" as dec1 #CE93D8
rectangle "Conv 1×1\n**Output Mask**\n(H × W × 1)" as output #E8F5E9

' === Vertical Alignments / Hidden Links for Side-by-Side Grid ===
input -[hidden]down-> enc1
enc1 -[hidden]down-> enc2
enc2 -[hidden]down-> enc3
enc3 -[hidden]down-> enc4
enc4 -[hidden]down-> bottleneck

dec1 -[hidden]down-> dec2
dec2 -[hidden]down-> dec3
dec3 -[hidden]down-> dec4
dec4 -[hidden]down-> output

' === Align Level 1, 2, 3, 4 horizontally ===
enc1 -[#2196F3,dashed]right-> dec1 : "Skip Connection"
enc2 -[#2196F3,dashed]right-> dec2 : "Skip Connection"
enc3 -[#2196F3,dashed]right-> dec3 : "Skip Connection"
enc4 -[#2196F3,dashed]right-> dec4 : "Skip Connection"

' === Flow Lines ===
input --> enc1
enc1 --> enc2
enc2 --> enc3
enc3 --> enc4
enc4 --> bottleneck

bottleneck -right-> dec4
dec4 -up-> dec3
dec3 -up-> dec2
dec2 -up-> dec1
dec1 --> output

legend right
  |= Warna |= Komponen |
  | <#BBDEFB> | Encoder (Contracting Path) |
  | <#FFA726> | Bottleneck |
  | <#EF5350> | Decoder (Expanding Path) |
  | <#2196F3> | Skip Connections |
endlegend

@enduml
